    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a financial risk analyst.\n\nAnalyze this loan:\n\n- Grade: {{$json[\"grade\"]}}\n- Interest Rate:{{ $json.interest_rate }}%\n- Debt-to-Income Ratio (DTI): {{$json[\"dti\"]}}%\n- Income Category:{{ $json.income_cat }}\n- Employment Length: {{$json[\"emp_length_int\"]}} years\n\nInstructions:\n- Explain if the loan is risky or safe\n- Focus on DTI, interest rate, income, employment, and grade\n- Keep explanation simple and under 80 words\n\nOutput: One clear paragraph only.",
